{"name": "DeckWrecking Pirates", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Command the ultimate pirate crew in this tactical roguelike deckbuilder.</strong> Roll the dice and assign them to your crew <i>or your enemies\u00a0</i>to control every action. Unleash brutal grid-based combos, and plunder items and relics. Build your pirate deck\u2026 and wreck enemy decks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/bf8b589ad529b1b8bc3df8083fe87c50.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign dice to allies <i>or</i> enemies to decide which actions they perform. Outsmart them and reduce RNG with clever strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/1531f094f38334740a16cc4272f1f00e.poster.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/1531f094f38334740a16cc4272f1f00e.webm?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/1531f094f38334740a16cc4272f1f00e.mp4?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/8d0f03bcba3f86cfcd577e7e952d51a5.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate enemy actions assigning dice to them. Win battles by defeating enemy pirates or wrecking their ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/1c369310a0fb8b6547661c4615014e78.poster.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/1c369310a0fb8b6547661c4615014e78.webm?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/1c369310a0fb8b6547661c4615014e78.mp4?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/529d78ed55dfc881c7fc44f1eca2fc1e.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your route carefully. Recruit and equip pirates from different clans, upgrade dice, plunder relics that shape your run, and discover powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/89801edcc2ad9b4af5060f33f546ae3f.poster.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/89801edcc2ad9b4af5060f33f546ae3f.webm?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/89801edcc2ad9b4af5060f33f546ae3f.mp4?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip items to pirates to completely transform how they play and break the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"414\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/a0c33b95edf4af3df214a0bc57360f08.poster.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/a0c33b95edf4af3df214a0bc57360f08.webm?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/a0c33b95edf4af3df214a0bc57360f08.mp4?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"288\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/f3a6aaa0b46b6eeedbcbf9138955b7f0.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/adcf5276653639c70319a2734539e583.poster.avif?t=1783455023\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/adcf5276653639c70319a2734539e583.webm?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/extras/adcf5276653639c70319a2734539e583.mp4?t=1783455023\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick Runs, Endless Replay</strong> \u2013 Conquer the seas in approx. 1-hour sessions, with save-anytime freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalize Your Starting Run</strong> \u2013 Choose different captains, starting powers, and ship combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Undo &amp; Preview Systems</strong> \u2013 Test wild combos, preview every outcome, and undo turns if you\u2019re not satisfied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete missions to unlock more content\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Or Unlock all to have everything straight away.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019re Anna and Alex, a small duo crew making big pirate dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DeckWrecking Pirates is crafted with our love for the deckbuilding genre, inspired mainly by\u00a0<i>Slice &amp; Dice </i>and <i>Lonestar,</i>, but with a pirate twist and dice-driven mechanics of our own.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A tactical roguelike deckbuilder where you roll dice, command your pirate crew, and even control your enemies. Build your deck\u2026 and wreck theirs!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995060/6f32f0c6f1917e7c1da18d88f8905565839dfb36/header.jpg?t=1783455023", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Card Game", "Roguelike", "Deckbuilding", "Turn-Based Strategy"], "developers": "Drac Blau Studio", "publishers": "Drac Blau Studio", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3995060", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 April 2026 - Request Access\n\n28 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Or34sg8fI7M", "first_seen": 1776376800.0, "review_rank": 823}